{
  "id": "423101",
  "resourceId": 231,
  "name": "伊莎貝爾",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c231_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c231_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "什麼也不用害怕。\n您，啊啊……我一定會保護您的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝您邀請我參加派對。\n能跟您在一起，是我的榮幸。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "我總是對您充滿好奇。\n想知道您在幹什麼，您和誰在一起。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "沒想到人這麼多。\n這件禮服本來只想給您一個人看的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "我整夜都在想像著您……哦不，\n是想著您徹夜難眠。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "所以，這場無聊的……\n哦不，華麗的派對什麼時候結束呢？\n我只想跟您在一起。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "您現在散完步了嗎？\n那就一起回家吧，回我們的家。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "一想到能跟您一起參加派對，\n我激動得整夜都睡不著。\n您能唱首甜美的搖籃曲，哄我入睡嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "啊，是您……賦予了我活著的意義。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "您今天穿的衣服，真的太適合您了。\n但衣服裡面……是不是準備了更棒的東西呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "現在不會再分心了吧？\n哪怕是為了您在乎的那些女人。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "我一直很好奇。\n如果我穿上這件衣服，您會是什麼表情。\n……果然美好到令人陶醉。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "只是一直看著您，我就很滿足了。您知道嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "您走遠一點也沒關係。\n只要還在我視線範圍之內就可以了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "您有沒有背著我聯絡別的女人呢，親愛的？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "雖然派對是聊天社交的場合沒錯……\n但若對方是女性，那就不太好了。親愛的。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "什麼？看到翅膀雕像就會想起我？\n哎呀，這樣我會不好意思……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "所以，該去哪裡才能享受只屬於我們兩人的派對呢？\n這裡人太多了，感覺不夠自由呢。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "這裡有好多妮姬。\n……早知道是這樣，就不該讓您來這裡了……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "結婚後新房就建在這附近吧。\n不需要隔音，牆壁可以盡量蓋薄一點。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "想念您，所以來找您了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "這裡充滿了您的香氣，我太喜歡了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "啊啊……可愛的人啊。\n我會為您清除一切礙眼的東西。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "喜歡嗎？這是我為您珍藏的禮服。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "以後可以更快地飛向您了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "是否更貼近您的喜好了呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "啊啊……這也是愛情的一種形態吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，請多依賴我一點。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "我會成為您唯一的盾牌。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "今天的派對上，除了我以外，誰也不准碰您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "您是不是……也對我有意思呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "這……該不會是您打算在\n只屬於我們兩人的派對上使用的東西？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "有了這個，我能想您想一整天呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "親愛的，我不會忘記今天的。永遠不會……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "……我彷佛擁有了您的一部分。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "我會珍藏一輩子的。謝謝您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "在未來，我想……成為您唯一的新娘。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "今夜……我太期待了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "我們果然愛著彼此，對吧？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "只屬於我們兩人的派對要開始了嗎？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "我想每晚在您身旁入睡。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "果然，您和我殷殷盼望的是同一個時刻。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "我來守護您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "看來是野外派對呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "您在叫我嗎……？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "是的，親愛的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "我馬上飛過去。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "那裡是舉辦我們的派對的地方嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "我要開始戰鬥了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "只屬於我們的派對上，搗蛋鬼太多了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "讓我幫您清理乾淨。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "請待在後方，稍等一下。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "我來守護您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "我馬上解決。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "沒關係。躲在我身後就好了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "我一定會保護好您的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "沒時間了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "派對快要遲到了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "我要守護這個人。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "那個人還在等我。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "要抓緊時間。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "不能讓他失望。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "該結束了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "快點解決吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "我會追殺到世界的盡頭。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "為了只屬於我們的派對……\n請你們都消失好嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "雖然不喜歡合作，但現在只能這樣了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "沒時間了。火力全開！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "去死！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "快結束了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "順利擊落。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "處理好了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "消失吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "……好麻煩。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "……唔。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "……禮服……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "不行。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "啊啊……我不能丟下您……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
      "text": "跟您的派對……啊……真對不起……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_83",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_83.mp3",
      "text": "……您果然很需要我。對吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_84",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_84.mp3",
      "text": "搗蛋鬼們都消失了。\n所以，只屬於我們兩人的派對，可以開始了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}